  "Edge ids are numbered in order of first appearance over slots 3t+k in all 19 meshes; every interior id is used by exactly two slots, every boundary id by one. Mesh +0xb0 equals the number of distinct edge ids and +0x38 equals max(index)+1 on all 19.",
